{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/a6ada7f43cac90652596d45523a221bb.poster.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/a6ada7f43cac90652596d45523a221bb.webm?t=1763174651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/a6ada7f43cac90652596d45523a221bb.mp4?t=1763174651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/8463978a2a3d6d6ca54d17d2a92829c5.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mei, a highly skilled and accomplished kunoichi, was just about to live her dream of a peaceful married life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, her final mission pits her and her fianc\u00e9 against unimaginable odds, as they have to infiltrate a suspicious village's corruption while posing as recently moved-in newlyweds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mei needs to uncover the secrets of the Hidden Village to complete her last task before her married life can begin. As darkness looms, will Mei be able to keep her promise to her beloved?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/ee6d7f3dc281437d336abb445941db3f.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Visual Novel you are free to explore the world as Mei, interacting with people you encounter along the way. Some may help you achieve your goal, but not everyone will be friendly... especially towards an attractive outsider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter random events and uncover secrets behind the corruption of the Village Elder. Utilize Mei's assets to extract information from the targets and undergo a variety of heated training that will ultimately bring you closer to completing your mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/47c3a23400f6cf7595c4b2f5c79fc490.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/6db57f6b533a5cebc2dc269f4d350a2a.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich main story with multiple subplots and fleshed-out dialogues with a diverse cast of characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Mei be able to settle down with her fianc\u00e9 as planned, or does fate have other plans for her? The story features multiple endings, and it\u2019s up to you to decide how hers concludes! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than a visual novel, the game system allows you to freely explore the world and its beautifully hand-crafted areas. As you explore, you will engage with the world's inhabitants, uncovering secrets and insights that will help you with your mission!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Events</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world comes alive with a variety of mini-events waiting to be discovered. Be sure to visit every location and interact with its inhabitants so you won't miss any!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Get Informed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/033f1e0a15850e43a97d2eabe309a01512c016c1.jpg"},{"name":"Guinea Pig","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/4eb520b95f62db781cebb8cb96f1c4211dfe7596.jpg"},{"name":"Crowd Pleaser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/aba64df27df542966c98a386121a4ccc903c661f.jpg"},{"name":"Talisman Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/f4a721be3d833040381882e174351db82d404ebb.jpg"},{"name":"Regular Visitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/4b4e3cc8f0c89ba9ad37f1436d335d664fd278db.jpg"},{"name":"Good Samaritan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/d8005c82fc41f0d15faec8f2b9fb217d8e218440.jpg"},{"name":"Unrecognizable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/1eeacd48821fd40cebe8e233f9a15340c6e2cdfa.jpg"},{"name":"Become Zen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/4c6bf4707b249934c9dc4ab305f31f109c338461.jpg"},{"name":"The Magic Mushroom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/e9a23a4c6413c3302d0407e610ee382d71613f36.jpg"},{"name":"A Whole New Experience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3670880/8986336a1db82797c6fd404d68c591feb10721b0.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670880?t=1763174651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/eef16b96d22fea9c5dcdc00d772b6ab96d226f2e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763174651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/7d958297febb03f88e5371bd237c03df70cdb000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763174651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/7d958297febb03f88e5371bd237c03df70cdb000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763174651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game contains explicit nudity, sexual acts, violence BDSM, drug/alcohol abuse and sexual assault/non-consensual sex."},"demos":[{"appid":3755780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/a6ada7f43cac90652596d45523a221bb.poster.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/a6ada7f43cac90652596d45523a221bb.webm?t=1763174651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/a6ada7f43cac90652596d45523a221bb.mp4?t=1763174651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/8463978a2a3d6d6ca54d17d2a92829c5.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mei, a highly skilled and accomplished kunoichi, was just about to live her dream of a peaceful married life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, her final mission pits her and her fianc\u00e9 against unimaginable odds, as they have to infiltrate a suspicious village's corruption while posing as recently moved-in newlyweds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mei needs to uncover the secrets of the Hidden Village to complete her last task before her married life can begin. As darkness looms, will Mei be able to keep her promise to her beloved?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/ee6d7f3dc281437d336abb445941db3f.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Visual Novel you are free to explore the world as Mei, interacting with people you encounter along the way. Some may help you achieve your goal, but not everyone will be friendly... especially towards an attractive outsider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter random events and uncover secrets behind the corruption of the Village Elder. Utilize Mei's assets to extract information from the targets and undergo a variety of heated training that will ultimately bring you closer to completing your mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/47c3a23400f6cf7595c4b2f5c79fc490.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=848 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/extras/6db57f6b533a5cebc2dc269f4d350a2a.avif?t=1763174651\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Narrative</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich main story with multiple subplots and fleshed-out dialogues with a diverse cast of characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Mei be able to settle down with her fianc\u00e9 as planned, or does fate have other plans for her? The story features multiple endings, and it\u2019s up to you to decide how hers concludes! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than a visual novel, the game system allows you to freely explore the world and its beautifully hand-crafted areas. As you explore, you will engage with the world's inhabitants, uncovering secrets and insights that will help you with your mission!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Events</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world comes alive with a variety of mini-events waiting to be discovered. Be sure to visit every location and interact with its inhabitants so you won't miss any!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["MLPP Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670880/df458c3744970a1648f9e57a1cde59cd0fa63cbc/header.jpg?t=1763174651","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Saikey Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670880/845292786/006f25b5fe05536a0e0f9e71b3cf56ed0b2f5ca7/1750421406/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749139224","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670880/845292786/006f25b5fe05536a0e0f9e71b3cf56ed0b2f5ca7/1750421406/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749139224","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670880/845292786/006f25b5fe05536a0e0f9e71b3cf56ed0b2f5ca7/1750421406/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749139224","id":257151745,"name":"EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151745/f4cb90cbbbd2d62c2a4edcce91e16f3c1d4a3782/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749139224"}],"name":"Fallen Kunoichi ~Netorare Hidden Village~","package_gr